    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkitok e Isaak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etaa apa Abraham olpayian kitok otobikoyie ilarin kumok oleng', netamayiana Olaitoriani Abraham te pooki toki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Abraham osinka lenye otobiko oleng te nkaji laa ninye oitasheiki imasaa enyena pooki, “Tipika enkaina ino abori enkupes ai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa kaainosie iyie olmumai to Laitoriani, te Nkai e keper o enkop, inchere miyamaki olayioni lai enkitok too ntoyie oo Lkanaan laa ninche amanya atua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ilo enkop ai olgelata lai, nirikoki olayioni lai Isaak enkitok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaisiaayiani ninye, “Eidimayu metanya enkitok aasuju alotu ena kop, karik olayioni lino arriny ina kop apa ning'uaa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Abraham ninye, “Toduaa ake mirriny olayioni lai ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Olaitoriani Enkai e keper laaitayio nanu te nkaji e papaai lai o te nkop apa naatoinyieki, laairorie naainosie olmumai aajoki, ‘Iishoritin inono aisho ena kop.’ Ekeirriwaa olmalaika lenye te dukuya iyie, naa ilo iyie arikoki olayioni lai entito te ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa tenemeyieu enkitok nikisuju iyie, nimikintoki olmumai lai aibung': kake mirrinyoki ake olayioni lai ine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa nepik osinka enkaina enye abori enkupes e Abraham olkitok lenye, nenya olmumai tenkaraki ina bae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nereu osinka intamesin tomon olkitok lenye nelo eya nkishorot kumok oo mpukunot pooki to lkitok lenye nedumunye alo Mesopotamia, enkanasa e Nahor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitigil intamesin kung tiauluo enkanasa te mbata enchorro etaa teipa erishata napuonu inkituaak aaoku enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Oi o Laitoriani Enkai o lkitok lai Abraham, inchooki ena olong dupoto aatoomono iyie, nintodolu enyorrata ino nauno to olkitok lai Abraham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, aitashe nanu te mbata enchorro e nkare, ore intoyie oo ltung'ana lena anasa egira aapuku aaipang'u aoku enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inchoo metaa ore entito najoki, aatoomono intadou emoti ino matooko enkare, naajoki tooko, naa kaokoki sii intamesin inono inchoo metaa ninye itegelaka osinka lino Isaak. Teina ayiolou ajo intodolua enyorrata nauno to olkitok lai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eton eitu eishu inkirorot, nemaniki Rabeka entito e Betuel olayioni le Milka, enkitok e Nahor olalashe le Abraham elotu eeta emoti to loililai lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa entito sidai oleng tiong'u, eselenkei neitu aikata eyiolou olee, nedoiki enchorro, neigany emoti enye, neilepu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekuet osinka anang'are ninye nejoki, “Aatoomono inchooki enkiti are naok te moti ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Tooko olkitok lai”, “nesiokisioki aitadou emoti te nkaina enye neisho ninye metooko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie eidip aishoo ninye metooko, etiaka, Ekaokoki sii intamesin inono o metaba anaa neraposho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eijililiaka emoti enye empeut neipirri arrinyo enchorro aoku omeitaraposho intamesin enyena pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'or osinka ninye aitirring'a meiro, ajurru tenaa keitudupo Olaitoriani elutunoto enye anaa keitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie eidip intamesin aatookisho, eitayio oltung'ani olgisoi le sahabu laa eoroti nabo e shekel enkiroishi, o lkataarri aare loo nkaik enyena oimu enkiroishi enye shekeli tomon e sahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo, “Aatasayia tolikioki ajo ira entito e ng'ae? Ketii olgilata likirrag enkaji e papaai lino?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye ninye, “Ara entito e Betuel olayioni le Milka otoikio Nahor.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ajoki, “Kiata sii pokira olkujita o lgilat ooirragi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirrug oltung'ani elukunya aserem Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo: “Meisisi Olaitoriani Enkai olkitok lai Abraham, leitu eing'uaa enyorrata enye nauno o enchunet enye to Laitoriani lai. Ore nanu, aatorikuo Olaitoriani te nkoitoi arikoki enkaji oo lalashera lo lkitok lai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipirri ina tito aliki enkaji e ng'otonye kuna baa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeta apa Rebeka olalashe oji enkarna enye Laban. Nepuku Laban akuet alo enetii ilo tung'ani te nchorro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie edol olgisoi o lkataarri otii inkaik e nkanashe, nening'u sii irorei le Rebeka enkanashe enye oojo, “Neija aatiaaka oltung'ani,” eshomo enetii oltung'ani; nenyorriki eitashe tembata oo ntamesin te nchorro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki, “Tijing'u, olomayiana lo Laitoriani, ainyoo peyie intashe tiauluo: naidipa aitobira enkaji o ewueji oo ntamesin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa etijing'ua ilo tung'ani atua aji, nelaku Laban ilolan too ntamesin, neisho ninye ninche endaa oo ntamesin. Neisho sii ninye enkare naisujie inkejek enyena o tenebo lelo oiriamunore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirragakinyeki ninye endaa meinosa, kake etejo ninye; “Manya endaa o metaba anaa nairo ororei laayawua.” Nejoki Laban ninye, “Iroro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa etejo ninye, “Ara nanu osinka le Abraham! Netamayiana Olaitoriani olkitok lai oleng, neitaa ninye karsis: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eishoo ninye inkishu, o ntare, inkoshola o sahabu, o sinkan, o nkaisiaayiak, o ntamesin o sirkon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Sara, enkitok olkitok lai etoikio ninye enkayioni etaa moruo. Ore nena masaa pooki neishoo olayioni lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aainosie olkitok lai olmumai ajoki, ‘Milo iyie ayamaki olayioni lai enkitok too ntoyie oo Lkanaan lena kop naamanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake shomo enkaji e papa lai, o ltung'ana lang torikoki olayioni lai enkitok.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Najoki nanu olkitok lai, ‘Eidimayu metanya enkitok aasuju nanu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake aatiaaka ninye nanu, ‘Ore Olaitoriani lalo te dukuya ninye naa keirriu olmalaika lenye tenebo iyie neitumunyan enkoitoi ino, nirikoki enkitok olayioni lai too ltung'ana lang le nkaji e papa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niking'uaa ina kata olmumai tinilo enetii iltung'ana laainei. Naa tinikimitiki ninche ninye, nimikintoki aibung iyie olmumai lai.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nalotu duoo nanu e nchorro najo, ‘Oi Olaitoriani Enkai olkitok lai Abraham, tenaa aitumunyana tena kata enkoitoi naim aitorioo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ing'ura aitashe nanu te mbata enchorro e nkare, inchoo entito nalotu aoku enkare naa tenajoki, “Aatoomono inchooki te moti ino; enkiti are naok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki nanu, Tooko naa kaokoki sii intamesin inono,” inchoo metaa ninye enkitok nategeleka Olaitoriani olayioni lo olkitok lai.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore sii ake eitu aishu enkiroroto oltau lai, ng'ura, nelotu Rebeka enapita emoti e nkare to loililai, nedoiki enchorro aoku enkare. Najoki ninye, ‘Aatoomono inchooki matooko.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesioki aitadou emoti enye to loililai lenye nejo; ‘Tooko, naa kaisho sii ninche ntamesin inono.’ Neaku atooko nanu neisho sii nena tamesin enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitoki aikilikuan ninye ajoki: ‘Ira entito e ng'ae?’ Nejo, ‘Entito e Betuel olayioni le Nahor otoikio ninye Milka.’ Napik olgisoi enkume enye olkataarri inkaik enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nairrug elukunya aserem Olaitoriani, naisis Olaitoriani Enkai o lkitok lai Abraham, ilo laatorikoyie te nkoitoi nasipa matoriko entito o lalashe lo lkitok lai arikoki olayioni lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata, tenaa aiyasiasa esupatisho o esipata to lkitok lai entolikioki nanu, naa tinimiasiasa entolikioki nanu peyie atum aibelekenyakinoyu enkaina e tatene arashu kedienye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal Laban o Betuel aajo, “Ore ena bae naa Olaitoriani eing'uaa. Mikindiim aatiaaki iyie entorrono anaa esidai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'ura neina Rebeka natii dukuya iyie, toriko ninye shomo metaa ninye enkitok olayioni lo lkitok lino anaa enairoro Olaitoriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie ening olaisiaayiani le Abraham irorei lenye neirrugo abaiki enkop te dukuya Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau ilo aisiaayiani intokitin naagol enkinyiang'a o enkosholai o sahabu o nkilani neisho ninche Rebeka. Eishoo sii ninye olalashe lenye tenebo ng'otonye intokitin naagol enkinyang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ninye o lelo tung'ana apa ootii tenebo ninye, nedaa neokisho, neirrag ine. Ore pee einyototo ninche tadekenya, nejo ninye, “Entushukoki enetii olkitok lai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo olalashe tenebo ng'otonye, “Enchoo entito eng'as aton tenebo iyiook inkuti olong'i, anaa napaji inkolong'i tomon, ore peyie eishunye neidim ashomo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka ninye ninche, “Mikintokiki ailitilit, anaa enaidipa Olaitoriani aitumunyana enkoitoi ai, enchooki mashomo enetii olkitok lai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninche; “Aikimpot entito aaikilikuan enajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipot ninche Rebeka, nejoki ninye, “Amaa airiamariyie ele tung'ani?” Newal ajo, “Ekalo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eishoo ninche Rebeka enkanashe enye meshomo tenebo enkaisiaayiani enye, o sinka le Abraham tenebo iltung'ana lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemayian ninche Rebeka ejoki:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
