        },
        {
          "text": "Eewuo apa Isaak ina kata eing'uaa Beer-lahai-roi nelotu abik te Negeb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuku Isaak alo ong'ata adamisho teipa, neraposhu inkonyek enyena, ngura nedol intamesin naapuonu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neraposhu Rebeka inkonyek enyena nedol Isaak, ore peyie edol ninye nedou te ntames, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki ilo aisiaayiani, “Kalo tung'ani lido olotu ti ong'ota anang'are iyiook?” Nejoki ilo aisiaayiani, “Olkitok lai.” Neitayu enkarasha aitoip kewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinosaki ilo aisiaayiani Isaak imbaa pooki naataasate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerik Isaak ninye atua olng'obor. Neya Rebeka neaku ninye enkitok enye, nenyorru ninye. Neaku eitagoloki apa Isaak te nkeeya e ng'otonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.67",
